WEBVTT

00:42:28.889 --> 00:42:31.680
because there is this aspect
of the unknown

00:42:31.704 --> 00:42:33.198
that's out of your control.

00:42:33.222 --> 00:42:35.648
You don't know how well
the company is going to do.

00:42:35.672 --> 00:42:37.751
You don't really know
how much money it has,

00:42:37.775 --> 00:42:41.765
you don't really know the things
that the executives are talking about.

00:42:41.789 --> 00:42:44.317
And I think that there is
a tremendous amount of trust

00:42:44.341 --> 00:42:46.622
that people put into organizations,

00:42:46.646 --> 00:42:48.865
in that they're going to take care of them

00:42:48.889 --> 00:42:50.389
and take care of their career.

00:42:51.290 --> 00:42:52.911
AG: What advice do you have, Dave,

00:42:52.935 --> 00:42:56.855
for people who go through
that kind of stigmatization experience?

00:42:58.099 --> 00:43:00.520
DF: Focus on what you learned,